msgid ""
"This enables the required Windows features, installs the WSL 2 kernel, and "
"installs Ubuntu. Reboot if prompted."
msgstr "這會啟用所需的 Windows 功能、安裝 WSL 2 核心，並安裝 Ubuntu。如有提示請重新開機。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/firmware/setup.rst:68
msgid ""
"After the reboot, Ubuntu launches and asks you to create a UNIX username and"
" password. This account is independent of your Windows account."
msgstr "重新開機後，Ubuntu 會啟動並要求你建立一個 UNIX 使用者名稱與密碼。此帳戶與你的 Windows 帳戶各自獨立。"

